                <head>No. 650.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Cable message, received at
                            <placeName>Washington</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1880-07-23">July 23, 1880—6.55
                        p.m</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To Secretary <hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Commission liquidation finished and adjourned: all powers adhered.</p>
                <closer><signed>FARMAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
